Z||000024||88-DOHC||12-05-2001||06:55 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by tomanyfieros:<BR><B>...and i asked him what the fastest the rav's ever gone? he said they were pedal to the metal, DOWN HILL going 103 mph! <BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>BWHAHAHAHAHAHAHA... probably had a tail wind too!<P>I sort of raced a ricer car one time back when my car was completely stock, and easily did over 115 (hard to go fast with traffic), and pedal wasn't even to the metal. Still, this is one of the funnier things I have read. <P>This is almost like comparing a RAV4 with a base 3000GT (not the VR4). Considering I have had a base 3000GT upto 140mph, I would have to put my money on the fiero. For that matter he probably even thinks 3000GT's are fast (well, they would be if they didn't weigh so much).<P>||||reg||1
